The visionary book Wikinomics argues that the new digital possibilities for collaboration and sharing will bring about social changes not limited to the online virtual space of the internet. The revelations of secret political information by Wikileaks should be seen withing that light. What remains to be see are the consequences for political power relations.&nbsp; 
